<title>JAPAN: Akai Elec to issue Euroyen convertible.</title>
<headline>Akai Elec to issue Euroyen convertible.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Akai Electric Co Ltd  ARRANGER - Bankers Trust Asia Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE Euroyen convertible  ISSUE NO   AMT  20 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISSU PRICE	MATURITY  8.Aug.01</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 15.Aug.97  CONV TO   1.Aug.01</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE  8.Aug.97   INT PAY</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 23.Jul.97  SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI		LAST NIS</p>
<p>NOTE: Coupon and conversion price have not yet been decided.</p>
